WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Module review · Brand, Identity & Image
Recap: Brand, Identity & Image

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
One clear brand, built on your purpose, that others can apply and trust from launch.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:26.281
You turned your mission, values and positioning into an identity people can recognise and trust: a promise you can keep, a voice, a naming logic, visual basics, guidelines and trust signals.

4
00:00:26.681 --> 00:00:27.281
One lesson at a time

5
00:00:27.281 --> 00:00:37.030
7.1 Brand, marketing and communications: Brand is what people expect from you, identity how you express it, image what people actually think.

6
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:46.778
7.2 Brand strategy and promise: A brand promise only works if your experience matches it, so it must fit your current size.

7
00:00:46.778 --> 00:00:58.267
7.3 Brand personality, voice and tone: Three or four personality traits drawn from your values give a voice others can share as they join.

8
00:00:58.667 --> 00:00:59.267
One lesson at a time

9
00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:09.385
7.4 Naming and brand architecture: Deciding how your names relate while you have only one is cheap and stops confusion as you grow.

10
00:01:09.385 --> 00:01:18.763
7.5 Visual identity: Visual identity is a system more than any single element, and it can start before a finished logo.

11
00:01:18.763 --> 00:01:29.141
7.6 Brand guidelines: Brand guidelines let others apply the brand without you, so it no longer lives only in your head.

12
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:30.141
One lesson at a time

13
00:01:30.141 --> 00:01:40.259
7.7 Credibility and trust signals: With no track record yet, the signs of legitimacy, accountability and effectiveness you can show matter even more.

14
00:01:40.259 --> 00:01:50.267
7.8 Brand consistency and governance: A few simple brand rules set now keep things consistent once others start producing materials.

15
00:01:50.867 --> 00:02:03.096
Your brand is the foundation for communications: your promise, voice and trust signals shape the messages, channels and stories you use to reach your first audiences.

16
00:02:03.696 --> 00:02:08.496
You check your brand platform and guidelines and download each exercise as a PDF.

17
00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:13.096
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
